rows.before:
Well, that was only at first.
My buddy's dead.
Now I can say flat out that that's how it is.{p}

rows.en:
Well, that was only at first.
My buddy's dead.
These days I can say that flat out.{p}

rows.before:
From far off, I could hear police sirens.
Hosoda must have called them.
Seeing this, how many people would ever believe what I say...?{p}Sinking unsteadily down into the pool of bright red blood, I pictured the red siren lights I would surely be seeing any moment now.{p}

rows.en:
From far off, I could hear police sirens.
Hosoda must have called them.
After seeing this, how many people would ever believe a word I say...?{p}Sinking unsteadily down into the pool of bright red blood, I pictured the red siren lights I would surely be seeing any moment now.{p}

rows.before:
I felt as though a horrible, squelching crunch echoed deep in my ears.
Yes, I really shouldn't have been close enough to actually hear it.
After all, the athletic field lay between the school gate where I stood and the school building...{p}

rows.en:
I felt as though a horrible, squelching crunch echoed deep in my ears.
Yes, I couldn't possibly have been close enough to actually hear it.
After all, the athletic field lay between the school gate where I stood and the school building...{p}

rows.before:
Three moles in a row on the left hand were her trademark, you see.
Well, well... so even after reincarnation, distinguishing features like moles that serve as a mark still remain.
It's just like the mark of Cain, isn't it?{p}

rows.en:
Three moles in a row on the left hand were her trademark, you see.
Well, well... so even after reincarnation, a distinguishing mark like moles still remains.
It's just like the mark of Cain, isn't it?{p}

rows.before:
You're scared of me?
Of course, you're the reincarnation of the one who killed my most precious brother.
You're afraid I'll take my revenge on you, aren't you?{p}

rows.en:
You're scared of me?
Of course you are. You're the reincarnation of the one who killed my most precious brother.
You're afraid I'll take my revenge on you, aren't you?{p}

rows.before:
{a}...
The truth is, they hate you, don't they?
I hate to kick you while you're down, but I do believe the Phantom will appear.{p}

rows.en:
{a}...
The truth is, they hate you, don't they?
Forgive me for kicking you while you're down, but I do believe the Phantom will appear.{p}

rows.before:
Fine, as long as he protects me.
When I leaned into him, I heard a whistle from somewhere.
"Who's that, teasing us... hm?"{p}

rows.en:
Fine, if he'll protect me.
When I leaned into him, I heard a whistle from somewhere.
"Who's that, teasing us... hm?"{p}

rows.before:
Actually, I'm the type who sees spirits pretty easily.
So Hino was always asking me.
He wanted an article out of it, so he really wanted me to go do a report on the forbidden restroom.{p}

rows.en:
Actually, I'm the type who sees spirits pretty easily.
So Hino was always pestering me about it.
He wanted an article out of it, so he really wanted me to do a report on the forbidden restroom.{p}

rows.before:
The rapping echoed loudly even out there.
And I could hear something like sobbing, too.
I left the place for the time being.{p}

rows.en:
The rapping echoed loudly even out there.
And I could hear something like sobbing, too.
I got away from there for the time being.{p}

rows.before:
I'd examine the toilet more closely.
To do that, just looking at it wouldn't cut it.
That's what I thought.{p}

rows.en:
I should examine the toilet more closely.
To do that, just looking at it wouldn't cut it.
That's what I thought.{p}

rows.before:
"Ms. Akiyama...
I found this this morning."
On the paper the girl held out as she said that,{p}

rows.en:
"Ms. Akiyama...
This morning, I found this."
On the paper the girl held out as she said that,{p}
